00:57:11,330 --> 00:57:14,160
相談ねはいはい 正論じゃ嫌な連中
Consultations, yeah right. Folks who hate righteous arguments,

692
00:57:14,160 --> 00:57:16,980
同情はないない 悪いのあなた
No sympathy whatsoever. You're the bad one.

693
00:57:17,240 --> 00:57:20,040
語彙が足りない 伝わらないわ
Vocabulary's lacking, it doesn't get across.

694
00:57:20,040 --> 00:57:22,840
感情はないない つまらないのよ
No emotions whatsoever, how boring.

695
00:57:23,600 --> 00:57:25,880
ドキドキドキ ドドキドクドキ
Thump-thump-thump, thump-thump-thump,

696
00:57:26,200 --> 00:57:29,000
さよならはもう 興味がないわ
Goodbyes, I'm no longer interested in them.

697
00:57:29,440 --> 00:57:31,840
ドキドキドキ ドドキドクドキ
Thump-thump-thump, thump-thump-thump,

698
00:57:31,900 --> 00:57:35,420
はいそれが 私の奪っておいて無駄
Yes, that's me. Trying to snatch it away is pointless.

699
00:57:35,580 --> 00:57:38,440
